he court has been through many trials, many debates, many Issues, Lord God. We leave this to your hands and to the judgment of history. But as we go on today, we pray, Lord God, that you will give us the strength, the wisdom, the patience, our Senate President, our leaders, the leaders of the House. Because even as we speak today, abortion is being discussed. And other great sins. So how can we ask you to heal our land unless we turn from our evil ways? Lord, teach us to turn from our evil ways. We lift this up to you in Jesus' mighty name. Amen.

