00:45:56,280 --> 00:46:02,540
Atty. Rainer P. Dela Fuente: Yung CEZA po, Cagayan Economic Zone Authority. If I may correct your honor, consultant pa rin po ako nila.

184
00:46:04,170 --> 00:46:05,050
Atty. Rainer P. Dela Fuente: Up to now.

185
00:46:05,290 --> 00:46:06,390
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: Sorry for that.

186
00:46:07,030 --> 00:46:32,630
Atty. Rainer P. Dela Fuente: Yes. So ang CEZA po kasi one of our supervising agencies and so far as AML matters. So again, as their advisor pagdating mo sa AML matters in crafting their supervisory framework, they are considered a supervisor po sa AML matters for their covered persons.

187
00:46:34,670 --> 00:46:47,200
Atty. Rainer P. Dela Fuente: CEZA covered persons that are under the AML regime. So doon sa aspeto na iyon, sa segment na iyon, doon tayo tumutulong. Crafty, the framework.

188
00:46:47,760 --> 00:47:24,800
Rep. Jose Manuel “Chel” I. Diokno: I'm very sorry to interrupt the defense and the witness. But may I know the relevance of this line of questioning? The witness apparently is delivering his credentials on anti-money laundering. But the respondent in this case is not being charged with any money laundering crimes. The issue before this court are all centered on unexplained wealth, non-declaration of SALN, and participation in business. And I haven't heard anything from this witness that would qualify him on those matters.

189
00:47:26,480 --> 00:47:27,840
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Mark, what do you say?

190
00:47:28,040 --> 00:47:46,870
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: I have to correct the good counsel. Under the articles of impeachment, there are actually allegations pertaining to money laundering and other related matters. So, we will tackle that issue later on, Your Honor. But in the meantime, Your Honor, can we just proceed with qualifying this?

191
00:47:47,130 --> 00:47:47,970
Rep. Jose Manuel “Chel” I. Diokno: At any rate,

192
00:47:47,970 --> 00:47:51,290
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: Your Honor, they presented an AML...

193
00:47:51,290 --> 00:47:52,970
Rep. Jose Manuel “Chel” I. Diokno: If I may be allowed to finish...

194
00:47:52,970 --> 00:47:56,470
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: In fact,

195
00:47:56,510 --> 00:48:15,870
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: Your Honor, they presented an AMLC witness. and they made interpretations on the data as well. They also presented their own witness, Your Honor. So, it is our position that, Your Honor, that we also have the prerogative to present our own expert on the witness.

196
00:48:16,630 --> 00:48:18,390
Rep. Jose Manuel “Chel” I. Diokno: May I speak, Your Honor?

197
00:48:18,390 --> 00:48:19,630
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, Honorable Diokno.

