00:48:51,490 --> 00:48:54,670
Rep. Jose Manuel “Chel” I. Diokno: allegation like that is too serious to let pass.

201
00:48:55,560 --> 00:49:00,020
Rep. Jose Manuel “Chel” I. Diokno: i hope that i will count you to it the council that you will show it at the

