00:50:14,780 --> 00:50:30,320
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So, we can skip with this if you will stipulate that he is an expert that can give his opinion with respect to AMLC documents identified by the prosecution and by the defense. Correct, Attorney Mark?

