00:50:48,330 --> 00:51:21,660
Rep. Jose Manuel “Chel” I. Diokno: I was questioning the relevance of the line of questioning of the Good Counsel. He responded by saying that it is relevant, but said that... The reason being that money laundering is included in the articles of impeachment, particularly Article 2. Since that is his contention, Your Honor, please may we hold him to that now and may we ask him to show the relevance of this line of questioning by pointing to the allegations of the Article 2 that according to him pertain to money laundering.

