03:44:21,290 --> 03:44:37,830
Atty. Rainer P. Dela Fuente: It gives our AMLC, the investigators, proper profiling of the concerned official. So they will be able to identify if this is within his or her business or financial capacity or profile.

642
03:44:38,270 --> 03:45:05,170
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: Alright, thank you po. Now let me direct your attention to the SALNs of the following public officials. These are unmarked but we will mark accordingly at the proper time, Your Honor. Can you flash that? Okay, can you zoom in please? So this is a SALN of our President Ferdinand Jr. Marcos. This is for the year 2022 filed in 2023. I'll just focus on two things.

