03:45:46,110 --> 03:46:06,360
Rep. Jose Manuel “Chel” I. Diokno: Your Honor, I would have to, I'm sorry to interrupt, but I would have to object to the question on the grounds of irrelevance and immateriality. The respondent who is on trial in this case and whatever may be in the SALN of another official. Really has nothing to do with any of the issues here.

648
03:46:07,010 --> 03:46:11,710
