03:48:55,670 --> 03:48:58,910
Atty. Rainer P. Dela Fuente: In this case, your honor, none. Again, this is harmless information.

657
03:48:59,630 --> 03:49:06,350
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: Alright, and let's go to the last portion pertaining to

658
03:49:08,080 --> 03:49:22,050
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: the total net worth. So, in just one year, Lumake, nagkaroon ng 200 million increase from 900,000, naging 1 billion, 157 million.

