03:49:26,010 --> 03:49:52,700
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: 867,589.20. Again, I'll let you take note of that. I'll show you one last SALN for the following year. For the year 2023, ah, 2024, filed in April 30, 2025, again for our President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. Let's go to those two portions, yung business and financial interests. It's still there. Araka Resources Corporation and El Paraíso Farms.

