03:49:54,450 --> 03:50:21,870
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: Incorporated, and then I'll go to the last portion, which is the total net worth. So, from 960,000 in a year, naging 1.1 billion, and then after another year, nag-200 million increase na naman, naging 1.3 billion pesos. Do you know how much the salary of the President is? If you know?

